{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24242","headline":"八月十五日夜同诸客翫月 · 白居易","name":"八月十五日夜同诸客翫月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月好共传唯此夜，境闲皆道是东都。\n嵩山表里千重雪，洛水高低两颗珠。\n清景难逢宜爱惜，白头相劝强欢娱。\n诚知亦有来年会，保得晴明强健无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}